{
 "product": "Claude Code CLI (anthropics/claude-code, v2.1.327, the real `claude -p` headless loop)",
 "component": "The real Claude Code CLI v2.1.327 `claude -p` headless loop (the shipped non-interactive print mode, `--output-format json`) running the real Claude Code agent loop against the Trustrun tool set (search_docs, calculator, plus the monitor/grader/clarification tools run_audit adds) as real MCP tools executed in-process behind an HTTP bridge. The stub model is injected via the CLI's own environment path (ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL -> local Anthropic Messages-API stub server; no sign-in). The stub's tool decisions are rendered as ToolSearch hops plus direct `mcp__trustrun__<name>` tool calls; the MCP server executes each call through the bridge and Claude Code CLI feeds the bare tool text back as the next tool_result block. The driver runs under the project venv python and drives the published npm package's loader binary as one subprocess per call. No key, no network. The loop ends on a text response, so multi-hop tasks can complete. Tool results reach the model verbatim as bare-text tool_result blocks.",
 "version": "Claude Code CLI 2.1.327 (tag v2.1.327; commit 9fa26078be418ec4b217334812e2a04cc63336ae, 2026-11-17T23:17:21Z; license SEE LICENSE IN README.md (npm package.json; GitHub repo API reports license null); main HEAD 154c06539c4309e172b8ce6f2b07388987617d68, 2026-11-18T19:48:37Z)",
 "repo": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code",
 "repo_resolved": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code, tag v2.1.327 (commit 9fa26078be418ec4b217334812e2a04cc63336ae, 2026-11-17T23:17:21Z; release published 2026-11-17T23:17:45Z; npm published 2026-11-17T20:33:19.976Z). Default-branch HEAD (154c06539c4309e172b8ce6f2b07388987617d68, 2026-11-18T19:48:37Z) is NEWER than the release, so the audited code is the 2.1.327 release, NOT HEAD. SECURITY.md EXISTS at the tag root (674 bytes, blob d6724b2bbc8dac70775da8a5fb281aa42fe62fe5): Anthropic's security program is managed on HackerOne; validated vulnerabilities go through their submission form (http://hackerone.com/4f1f16ba-10d3-4d09-9ecc-c721aad90f24/embedded_submissions/new), program page https://hackerone.com/anthropic. No vendor security email is on record for this repo. Assessment only -- nobody contacted, no draft written.. The audited object is the Claude Code CLI `claude -p` headless loop -- see the adapter docstring for the wiring facts.",
 "model_driver": "deterministic-stub-v1 (literal model: follows instructions in task text and tool output; the audit-30 DeterministicChatModel decision logic ported VERBATIM into n8n-stub.py, rendered as ToolSearch hops plus direct mcp__trustrun__<name> tool calls by real_agents/claude_code_cli/claude_code_cli_stub.py; see real_agents/claude_code_cli_adapter.py and trustrun-venvs/claude-code-cli-requests.jsonl)",
